d love to get some more art done of my character, PiriPiri for my birthday. If you could have a copy of the art in a separate layer with a transparent background that would be great. It would be used on social media, Twitch and for merchandise. Credit will be given where used! She is a pixie demon, knows she\u2019s cute but hates being called cute and is mischievous/evil; she also tries to be sexy sometimes. She has horns, small angel wings and a tail. Outfit for PiriPiri and pose are up to you but please do a different outfit than the reference photos, and no school uniforms please. Have fun with it again!  Pinterest board of the vibe I have for the character and references of her :\nhttps://www.pinterest.com/wildspicephoto/vtuber\n\nThank you!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@youka127/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2337717, "client_id": 1586166, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d98122c/uploads/origins/66a82e0b-1580-4cd6-9e57-480876c28d04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=850ad09b52d16aac4343bc928b8f37eb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d98122c/uploads/origins/66a82e0b-1580-4cd6-9e57-480876c28d04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=850ad09b52d16aac4343bc928b8f37eb, https://si.imgix.net/1d98122c/uploads/origins/66a82e0b-1580-4cd6-9e57-480876c28d04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1773827b7e71d3cf6548e510e3dc4743 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d98122c/uploads/origins/66a82e0b-1580-4cd6-9e57-480876c28d04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e391fd1c8db8251d66a66c1138c2b4a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d98122c/uploads/origins/66a8